1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 7=

3
00:00:26,655 --> 00:00:28,855
I never thought the great Jiasheng

4
00:00:29,815 --> 00:00:31,015
would end up like this.

5
00:00:33,695 --> 00:00:35,015
Are you here to mock me?

6
00:00:35,015 --> 00:00:36,294
I'm here to see your downfall.

7
00:00:36,294 --> 00:00:37,894
When you killed my sister,

8
00:00:38,055 --> 00:00:39,894
did you ever think you'd see this day?

9
00:00:39,934 --> 00:00:41,015
About your sister's death,

10
00:00:41,854 --> 00:00:43,255
you know better than anyone.

11
00:00:43,534 --> 00:00:44,695
You think following Nie Feng

12
00:00:44,774 --> 00:00:46,335
will wipe the slate clean?

13
00:00:46,375 --> 00:00:47,534
About my sister's death,

14
00:00:48,174 --> 00:00:49,814
the police already got a conviction.

15
00:00:50,134 --> 00:00:51,895
You murdered her.

16
00:00:52,214 --> 00:00:53,534
You're sitting here right now

17
00:00:53,575 --> 00:00:55,094
because that's what you deserve.

18
00:00:55,174 --> 00:00:56,414
You came all the way here

19
00:00:57,134 --> 00:00:58,575
just to spew all this nonsense?

20
00:00:59,534 --> 00:01:00,534
I want

21
00:01:01,854 --> 00:01:03,375
to hear you confess,

22
00:01:03,494 --> 00:01:04,494
and I want to see

23
00:01:04,695 --> 00:01:05,895
just how miserable you are.

24
00:01:07,174 --> 00:01:08,174
You're as stupid as ever.

25
00:01:08,935 --> 00:01:09,935
Following Nie Feng,

26
00:01:09,935 --> 00:01:11,534
you'll die worse than your sister!

27
00:01:11,975 --> 00:01:13,814
4167, sit down!

28
00:01:14,014 --> 00:01:15,014
Then let's see

29
00:01:15,175 --> 00:01:16,815
which of us dies worse in the end.

30
00:01:16,975 --> 00:01:17,975
Get lost!

31
00:01:20,255 --> 00:01:21,255
Don't ever come back.

32
00:01:22,374 --> 00:01:23,374
Move!

33
00:01:31,494 --> 00:01:32,494
Don't worry.

34
00:01:33,494 --> 00:01:34,735
I won't come back.

35
00:01:36,455 --> 00:01:37,975
Even looking at you makes me sick.

36
00:01:42,335 --> 00:01:43,414
Very well.

37
00:01:43,934 --> 00:01:45,414
She's a smart girl.

38
00:01:45,735 --> 00:01:47,134
Much sharper than her sister.

39
00:01:50,214 --> 00:01:51,574
Nice act back there.

40
00:01:52,175 --> 00:01:53,695
Aren't you afraid I'll rat you out?

41
00:01:54,654 --> 00:01:55,654
You won't.

42
00:01:56,214 --> 00:01:57,214
Why?

43
00:01:57,455 --> 00:01:58,494
If you wanted to hurt me,

44
00:01:58,615 --> 00:01:59,735
when Shui spiked my drink,

45
00:01:59,735 --> 00:02:01,175
you could've looked the other way.

46
00:02:03,095 --> 00:02:04,735
What's exactly written on that note?

47
00:02:05,815 --> 00:02:07,574
4167, sit down!

48
00:02:07,574 --> 00:02:08,815
Then let's see

49
00:02:09,214 --> 00:02:11,095
which of us dies worse in the end.

50
00:02:11,294 --> 00:02:12,735
You'll find out soon enough.

51
00:02:16,455 --> 00:02:18,135
"Cut Phachai's
tobacco and liquor supply.

52
00:02:18,214 --> 00:02:19,575
Dig into Xia Yuyan's background.

53
00:02:20,214 --> 00:02:21,214
ASAP."

54
00:02:25,455 --> 00:02:26,654
It's Jiasheng's handwriting.

55
00:02:27,374 --> 00:02:29,295
I'll handle
the tobacco and liquor supply.

56
00:02:30,135 --> 00:02:31,575
Then I'll look into Xia Yuyan.

57
00:02:32,934 --> 00:02:33,934
Can you do that?

58
00:02:35,055 --> 00:02:36,575
I've been at Prosperity for so long.

59
00:02:36,735 --> 00:02:38,295
And I've built up my own connections.

60
00:02:38,814 --> 00:02:40,335
Looking into someone is no problem.

61
00:02:40,814 --> 00:02:41,814
Don't worry.

62
00:02:44,295 --> 00:02:45,295
It's settled then.

63
00:02:46,175 --> 00:02:47,214
Let's split up.

64
00:02:56,015 --> 00:02:57,135
You looking to die?

65
00:02:57,534 --> 00:02:58,895
You dare stop a Yanyue Gang's truck?

66
00:03:08,855 --> 00:03:10,415
No more deliveries to Sea Breeze Prison.

67
00:03:10,735 --> 00:03:11,735
You send one,

68
00:03:11,974 --> 00:03:12,974
and I burn one.

69
00:03:56,934 --> 00:03:59,295
No cigarettes?
How the heck am I supposed to live?

70
00:03:59,335 --> 00:04:00,494
Give me cigarettes!

71
00:04:01,814 --> 00:04:04,295
- Cigarettes!
- Give me cigarettes!

72
00:04:05,102 --> 00:04:06,990
- Cigarettes!
- Cigarettes, now!

73
00:04:06,990 --> 00:04:08,089
- Cigarettes!
- I want cigarettes!

74
00:04:08,089 --> 00:04:10,534
- I can't live without them!
- Ever since Sea Breeze Prison opened,

75
00:04:10,534 --> 00:04:12,214
there's never been such chaos.

76
00:04:13,369 --> 00:04:15,219
Cigarettes! Give me cigarettes!

77
00:04:16,318 --> 00:04:17,547
Give me booze!

78
00:04:19,615 --> 00:04:22,494
Cigarettes!

79
00:04:24,259 --> 00:04:26,571
- Give me cigarettes!
- This is going to kill us!

80
00:04:26,814 --> 00:04:28,334
- Mr. Tu.
- Give me cigarettes!

81
00:04:28,334 --> 00:04:29,934
Was it you who cut off the cigarettes?

82
00:04:31,452 --> 00:04:32,452
Give me cigarettes!

83
00:04:32,649 --> 00:04:33,707
Cigarettes!

84
00:04:35,214 --> 00:04:36,241
Give me cigarettes!

85
00:04:36,374 --> 00:04:37,374
I've got brothers.

86
00:04:37,832 --> 00:04:38,832
Give me booze!

87
00:04:39,295 --> 00:04:40,535
Only you could pull this off.

88
00:04:40,934 --> 00:04:41,975
Truly impressive.

89
00:04:46,374 --> 00:04:48,215
Block A is on fire. Situation unknown.

90
00:04:48,374 --> 00:04:50,014
Inmates in Blocks B and C are rioting.

91
00:04:50,254 --> 00:04:51,415
Other blocks are rioting too.

92
00:04:51,494 --> 00:04:52,694
It's all about cigarettes.

93
00:04:53,175 --> 00:04:54,415
Captain Xia has taken men over.

94
00:04:56,735 --> 00:04:58,134
Pass my order to Captain Xia:

95
00:04:58,334 --> 00:04:59,334
before dawn,

96
00:04:59,334 --> 00:05:00,975
the riot must be put down.

97
00:05:01,735 --> 00:05:03,454
- Yes, sir.
- One more thing.

98
00:05:03,454 --> 00:05:04,454
Where is Phachai?

99
00:05:05,095 --> 00:05:06,175
Fearing inmate retaliation,

100
00:05:06,535 --> 00:05:07,535
he's hiding in his villa.

101
00:05:08,574 --> 00:05:09,574
Bring him to me.

102
00:05:09,814 --> 00:05:10,814
Remember,

103
00:05:10,855 --> 00:05:11,855
take extra men,

104
00:05:11,934 --> 00:05:13,055
and bring riot gear.

105
00:05:13,855 --> 00:05:14,855
Understood.

106
00:05:16,454 --> 00:05:17,454
Stop it!

107
00:05:32,254 --> 00:05:33,694
Everyone, back to your cells!

108
00:05:34,095 --> 00:05:35,415
Cut it out right now!

109
00:06:04,615 --> 00:06:07,254
Take everyone
causing trouble to solitary!

110
00:06:11,655 --> 00:06:12,735
On the cigarettes and booze,

111
00:06:12,894 --> 00:06:14,655
we'll give you
an official answer tomorrow.

112
00:06:15,014 --> 00:06:16,014
Today,

113
00:06:16,055 --> 00:06:17,574
anyone who starts a fight

114
00:06:17,694 --> 00:06:19,014
faces maximum penalties:

115
00:06:19,735 --> 00:06:20,975
no yard time for three months,

116
00:06:21,295 --> 00:06:22,454
and all visits suspended!

117
00:06:23,095 --> 00:06:24,374
What the heck happened?

118
00:06:24,655 --> 00:06:25,655
Tang,

119
00:06:25,894 --> 00:06:27,014
you can't blame me for this.

120
00:06:27,374 --> 00:06:28,934
Tu Jiasheng found someone outside

121
00:06:29,215 --> 00:06:30,215
to cut our supply.

122
00:06:30,494 --> 00:06:31,494
But don't worry,

123
00:06:31,574 --> 00:06:33,415
I'm working on a solution right now.

124
00:06:33,694 --> 00:06:34,894
I only care about the money.

125
00:06:35,494 --> 00:06:36,655
However you handle it,

126
00:06:37,095 --> 00:06:38,295
the cut you owe me

127
00:06:38,295 --> 00:06:39,334
can't be a cent short.

128
00:06:40,574 --> 00:06:41,574
With the supply cut

129
00:06:41,775 --> 00:06:42,775
and nothing to sell,

130
00:06:43,334 --> 00:06:44,655
how am I supposed to pay you?

131
00:06:46,535 --> 00:06:47,775
Do you know how many people

132
00:06:47,775 --> 00:06:49,175
are waiting to take your place?

133
00:06:49,694 --> 00:06:50,855
If you can't handle it,

134
00:06:51,415 --> 00:06:52,615
I'll handle it my way.

135
00:06:56,814 --> 00:06:57,814
Fine.

136
00:06:58,095 --> 00:06:59,095
Tomorrow.

137
00:06:59,615 --> 00:07:00,814
Tomorrow, I'll bring your cut

138
00:07:01,374 --> 00:07:02,374
over to you.

139
00:07:05,215 --> 00:07:07,655
Bring all the cigarettes and booze
you stashed

140
00:07:07,894 --> 00:07:08,894
in your villa.

141
00:07:09,095 --> 00:07:10,095
Tang,

142
00:07:10,655 --> 00:07:12,415
- I don't have...
- Phachai,

143
00:07:12,415 --> 00:07:13,615
should I search it myself?

144
00:07:15,975 --> 00:07:17,855
We contained it for tonight.

145
00:07:18,535 --> 00:07:20,254
Without something real tomorrow,

146
00:07:20,334 --> 00:07:21,494
another riot will break out,

147
00:07:23,134 --> 00:07:24,494
and neither of us can handle that.

148
00:07:26,855 --> 00:07:28,535
- Inmate 0927.
- Here.

149
00:07:28,535 --> 00:07:29,535
Interrogation time.

150
00:07:29,574 --> 00:07:30,574
Yes, ma'am.

151
00:07:39,175 --> 00:07:40,334
This is how you hit back?

152
00:07:42,334 --> 00:07:43,535
Good work, Captain Xia.

153
00:07:44,494 --> 00:07:46,014
If this blows up further,

154
00:07:46,894 --> 00:07:48,215
can you handle the consequences?

155
00:07:49,894 --> 00:07:50,934
With you here,

156
00:07:51,574 --> 00:07:52,735
Sea Breeze won't fall apart.

157
00:07:57,334 --> 00:07:58,934
To build a new order,

158
00:07:59,814 --> 00:08:01,295
we must tear down the old.

159
00:08:01,574 --> 00:08:02,574
So

160
00:08:03,175 --> 00:08:05,134
you want to run
the cigarette and liquor trade?

161
00:08:06,415 --> 00:08:07,494
You didn't think

162
00:08:08,574 --> 00:08:10,334
I just wanted to mess
with Phachai, did you?

163
00:08:11,014 --> 00:08:12,014
You're not short on money.

164
00:08:12,215 --> 00:08:13,574
Who'd turn down more money?

165
00:08:14,494 --> 00:08:16,415
I just like having the upper hand.

166
00:08:27,975 --> 00:08:29,535
Tang Zhen won't work with you.

167
00:08:30,095 --> 00:08:31,295
On my way here,

168
00:08:32,014 --> 00:08:33,374
I saw Phachai go see him.

169
00:08:33,655 --> 00:08:34,655
Tang,

170
00:08:34,894 --> 00:08:36,095
the rage of those inmates

171
00:08:36,494 --> 00:08:37,615
is actually a good thing.

172
00:08:38,175 --> 00:08:39,175
We can use it.

173
00:08:39,894 --> 00:08:40,894
We can tell them

174
00:08:41,014 --> 00:08:42,214
that Tu Jiasheng is behind it

175
00:08:43,015 --> 00:08:44,334
and direct all their rage

176
00:08:44,614 --> 00:08:45,854
onto Tu Jiasheng.

177
00:08:46,655 --> 00:08:47,655
He can fight,

178
00:08:47,655 --> 00:08:48,655
but against ten

179
00:08:49,055 --> 00:08:50,055
or twenty...

180
00:08:50,334 --> 00:08:51,375
The inmates in Sea Breeze

181
00:08:51,895 --> 00:08:52,895
number in the hundreds.

182
00:08:53,415 --> 00:08:55,375
They could drown him even in spit.

183
00:08:55,934 --> 00:08:57,295
As long as Tu Jiasheng is alive,

184
00:08:57,814 --> 00:08:59,094
there will be endless trouble.

185
00:09:00,055 --> 00:09:01,255
If Sea Breeze wants peace,

186
00:09:01,614 --> 00:09:02,694
he cannot stay alive.

187
00:09:04,574 --> 00:09:05,814
Scheming how to kill me, right?

188
00:09:05,895 --> 00:09:06,974
Good that you know.

189
00:09:07,135 --> 00:09:08,135
Go take care of it.

190
00:09:14,175 --> 00:09:15,614
Let's see how this plays out.

191
00:09:18,214 --> 00:09:20,255
Fair skin, pretty face, long legs:
all of them.

192
00:09:22,495 --> 00:09:24,295
They're way prettier in person.

193
00:09:27,293 --> 00:09:28,792
Come over.

194
00:09:29,355 --> 00:09:30,355
Come on over.

195
00:09:38,614 --> 00:09:40,614
Look at me.
Then look at your pathetic face.

196
00:09:40,655 --> 00:09:42,135
If you can't handle it, go home.

197
00:09:45,694 --> 00:09:48,255
Don't be scared.
We're not playing this today.

198
00:09:51,694 --> 00:09:53,814
Let's try something new, okay?

199
00:10:05,895 --> 00:10:06,895
Look.

200
00:10:07,055 --> 00:10:08,055
Don't be afraid.

201
00:10:21,454 --> 00:10:22,454
A hot shower.

202
00:10:23,255 --> 00:10:24,255
Don't be afraid.

203
00:10:25,495 --> 00:10:26,495
Be good.

204
00:10:28,814 --> 00:10:29,814
Turn around.

205
00:10:31,094 --> 00:10:32,214
Take off your clothes.

206
00:10:32,895 --> 00:10:33,895
Be good and lie down.

207
00:10:35,854 --> 00:10:36,854
Take off your clothes!

208
00:10:37,454 --> 00:10:38,454
Lie down!

209
00:10:48,495 --> 00:10:49,495
That's it.

210
00:10:55,814 --> 00:10:56,854
Here I come.

211
00:11:03,734 --> 00:11:04,734
Feels good?

212
00:11:07,214 --> 00:11:08,214
Now scream.

213
00:11:32,646 --> 00:11:36,262
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

214
00:11:36,632 --> 00:11:40,617
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

215
00:11:45,373 --> 00:11:48,692
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

216
00:11:48,692 --> 00:11:53,777
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

217
00:11:57,366 --> 00:12:03,918
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

218
00:12:03,918 --> 00:12:12,339
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

219
00:12:12,339 --> 00:12:15,568
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

220
00:12:15,568 --> 00:12:18,763
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

221
00:12:18,763 --> 00:12:21,456
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

222
00:12:21,456 --> 00:12:26,073
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

223
00:12:29,984 --> 00:12:32,473
♪Burning alone♪

224
00:12:37,979 --> 00:12:44,348
♪The glory fades♪
